## ⚡ QUICK START (30 SEGUNDOS)

```bash
# 1. Criar repo
mkdir sec-plus && cd sec-plus && git init

# 2. Frontend
npm create vite@latest frontend -- --template react-ts

# 3. Backend
mkdir backend && cd backend && npm init -y

# 4. Rodar
cd ../frontend && npm run dev
# Em outro terminal:
cd backend && npm install express cors dotenv && npm run dev

# 5. Abrir browser
# http://localhost:5173 → SEC+ app
```

